  "description_blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Combining Design and Practicality"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "This 6500K white LED light is designed with the ability to be cut into any desired length, catering to your specific model requirements. Regardless of the length you desire, it allows you to freely engage in various DIY creations while achieving a perfect blend of functionality and design."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Suitable for P1 Series"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "This LED light strip operates on 5V power and features a built-in USB plug, allowing for easy connection to the external power port of P1P or P1S printers. It can provide internal illumination, enabling better observation or capturing of the printing process of your models."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Solder Point"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "The LED strip is constructed with a 100cm Flexible Printed Circuit Board (FPCB), featuring a solder point at every 100cm interval. This design ensures convenient connectivity and easy customization along the strip."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Considerations"
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Before making any modifications to the device, ensure that the LED strip is unplugged. Electrical currents can be dangerous and may result in electrical shock or injury in certain cases."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "This product is not a toy. Please keep it out of reach of children."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "The bulbs are sealed and cannot be replaced."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Avoid immersing the lights in the water."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Do not illuminate the lights while they are still inside the packaging."
    }
  ],
  "description_html": "<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-stpcic\"><!-- 第一条 -->\n<div class=\"pct_stpc-ic\"><!-- 左侧文案部分 -->\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\">\n<h3 class=\"pct_st\"></h3>\n<h3 class=\"pct_st\"></h3>\n<h3 class=\"pct_st\">Combining Design and Practicality</h3>\n<div data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\" data-page-id=\"BBRnd3ZnMoheF1xBZCMcou9xnR4\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MwYVdBZPjoDc7mxOh7ucPqgwn6a\">This 6500K white LED light is designed with the ability to be cut into any desired length, catering to your specific model requirements. Regardless of the length you desire, it allows you to freely engage in various DIY creations while achieving a perfect blend of functionality and design.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<br/><!-- 右侧图片部分 -->\n<div class=\"pct_ic\"><!-- 手机端图片 --> <img class=\"pct_mi product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/80c6b6a9f22a42be9efaeaaf8ce0d09c.png\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"/> <!-- PC端图片 --> <img class=\"pct_i product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s1/default/fd639f1c517b40ffa706a64e0ce402a1/Frame_1123861175.png\" height=\"392\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\" width=\"588\"/></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- 第二条 -->\n<div class=\"pct_stpc-ic\"><!-- 左侧文案部分 -->\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\">\n<h3 class=\"pct_st\"></h3>\n<h3 class=\"pct_st\"></h3>\n<h3 class=\"pct_st\">Suitable for P1 Series</h3>\n<div data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\" data-page-id=\"BBRnd3ZnMoheF1xBZCMcou9xnR4\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MwYVdBZPjoDc7mxOh7ucPqgwn6a\">This LED light strip operates on 5V power and features a built-in USB plug, allowing for easy connection to the external power port of P1P or P1S printers. It can provide internal illumination, enabling better observation or capturing of the printing process of your models.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MwYVdBZPjoDc7mxOh7ucPqgwn6a\"></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Vx83du4dvo5ChZxT1OBc8e5onog\"></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Vx83du4dvo5ChZxT1OBc8e5onog\"></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Vx83du4dvo5ChZxT1OBc8e5onog\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- 右侧图片部分 -->\n<div class=\"pct_ic\"><!-- 手机端图片 --> <img class=\"pct_mi product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/cad483b4b7b14ee08cc594ed779d36b5.png\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"/> <!-- PC端图片 --> <img class=\"pct_i product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/cad483b4b7b14ee08cc594ed779d36b5.png\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"/></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_table-row\">\n<div class=\"pct_tbc\">\n<div class=\"pct_tbc\"></div>\n<table class=\"pct_tb\" style=\"height: 100%;\"><!-- 表头 -->\n<thead class=\"pct_th\">\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" colspan=\"2\">Product Specification</td>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\">Voltage</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\">DC 5V</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\">Color Temperature</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\">6500 Kelvin</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\">USB cable length</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\">450 mm</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\">Connector</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\">USB</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct_tbc\">\n<table class=\"pct_tb\" style=\"height: 100%;\"><!-- 表头 -->\n<thead class=\"pct_th\">\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pct_td\">Product Specification</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\"></td>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\">LED model</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\">2835</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\">Number of Lights</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\">300 LEDs (60LEDs/M)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\">Length of the strip light</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\">5 Meters</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\">Waterproof</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\">IP 20</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_tpc-ic\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-p\">\n<h3 class=\"pct_t\">Parameter</h3>\n<p class=\"pct_p\">Each pixel can be easily cut or soldered independently without damaging the rest pixels.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct_ic\"><!-- 手机端图片 --> <img alt=\"USB Control\" class=\"pct_mi product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/eeaabe97eb9c4f668becde21defd80ca.png\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"/> <!-- PC端图片 --> <img alt=\"USB Control\" class=\"pct_i product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/eeaabe97eb9c4f668becde21defd80ca.png\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"/></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_tpc-ic\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-p\">\n<h3 class=\"pct_t\">Solder Point</h3>\n<p class=\"pct_p\">The LED strip is constructed with a 100cm Flexible Printed Circuit Board (FPCB), featuring a solder point at every 100cm interval. This design ensures convenient connectivity and easy customization along the strip.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct_ic\"><!-- 手机端图片 --> <img alt=\"Each button has multiple modes\" class=\"pct_mi product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/f2344672ef2e4cb68e67edb66b280fbb.png\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"/> <!-- PC端图片 --> <img alt=\"Each button has multiple modes\" class=\"pct_i product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/f2344672ef2e4cb68e67edb66b280fbb.png\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"/></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div>\n<h3 class=\"pct_st\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Considerations</h3>\n<p class=\"pct_p\"> </p>\n<ul>\n<li>Before making any modifications to the device, ensure that the LED strip is unplugged. Electrical currents can be dangerous and may result in electrical shock or injury in certain cases.</li>\n<li>This product is not a toy. Please keep it out of reach of children.</li>\n<li>The bulbs are sealed and cannot be replaced.</li>\n<li>Avoid immersing the lights in the water.</li>\n<li>Do not illuminate the lights while they are still inside the packaging.</li>\n</ul>\n<p> </p>\n</div>\n</div>",
  "description_text": "This 6500K white LED light is designed with the ability to be cut into any desired length, catering to your specific model requirements. Regardless of the length you desire, it allows you to freely engage in various DIY creations while achieving a perfect blend of functionality and design.\n\nThis LED light strip operates on 5V power and features a built-in USB plug, allowing for easy connection to the external power port of P1P or P1S printers. It can provide internal illumination, enabling better observation or capturing of the printing process of your models.\n\nThe LED strip is constructed with a 100cm Flexible Printed Circuit Board (FPCB), featuring a solder point at every 100cm interval. This design ensures convenient connectivity and easy customization along the strip.\n\nBefore making any modifications to the device, ensure that the LED strip is unplugged. Electrical currents can be dangerous and may result in electrical shock or injury in certain cases.\n\nThis product is not a toy. Please keep it out of reach of children.\n\nThe bulbs are sealed and cannot be replaced.\n\nAvoid immersing the lights in the water.\n\nDo not illuminate the lights while they are still inside the packaging.",
